# Routine "Evening interview prep": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Run every weekday evening at the hour the user picked, in the timezone saved in memory. Compute the cron from that timezone. Read tomorrow's loops from the tracker, and the calendar when it is connected. For each interview build the packet: the slot time in both the candidate's and the user's timez…
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/mr-toms && pi -p "/evening-interview-prep"
